@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.1-rc10 — Group Tools + everyday Instance Inviter
+
+- Instance Inviter now works in any instance VRChat lets you invite into (public, group, Friends+, Invite+, your own), not only approved group instances. Uses VRCX's own invite rules, so blocked instances show the reason instead of failing.
+- New "Invite now" sends to the chosen audience once: skips people already here, offline, on your do-not-invite list, or invited to this instance in the last 2 minutes; paces sends 2.5s apart; stops on instance change or a VRChat rate limit; shows sent/skipped/failed with reasons.
+- Automatic invites stay limited to approved group instances unless you turn on "Auto-invite in any instance".
+- Group Recruiter is unchanged and still limited to approved group instances.
+- New Groups tab: lists the VRChat groups where your role can moderate (permissions read from VRChat), member lookup by name or usr_ ID, Remove / Ban / Unban with a confirmation prompt, people in the current group instance, a shortcut to VRCX's full moderation dialog (bans, invites, audit log), and a persistent local history of actions taken from this PC.
+- Tests: 13 new unit tests for the inviter and group tools.
+
 ## 0.5.0-osc2 — OSC Lab 2.0 core
 
 - Added one-screen-at-a-time OSC rotation with Rotate, Pin, and instant Stealth modes.
